**TASK 3 (10 marks)**

The C and Pascal programs below perform the same task. Select any one of them and answer the questions that follow.

**C Program**

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
  int i, num;
  printf("Enter a number: ");
  scanf("%d",&num);
  for (i=4;i<=num;i++)
      printf("%d  ",i);
  getchar();
}
```

**Pascal Program**

```pascal
program Numbers;
var i,num: integer;
BEGIN
    write('Enter a number: ');
    readln(num);
    for i := 4 to num do
       write(i,'  ');
    readln;
END.
```
